      "text": "* User can enable/disable location sharing.\n* Client uploads location every 30 seconds.\n* User can view nearby friends.\n* Friends entering the radius should appear.\n* Friends leaving the radius should disappear.\n* Support configurable radius (1km, 5km, 10km, etc.).",
